    "innovation": "By integrating genetically identified archeological remains with paleoclimate models, this study reconstructs the Holocene niches of European and Atlantic sturgeons, confirming their thermal differences and identifying historical habitat overlaps to inform future conservation and reintroduction strategies.",
    "kg_extraction_triplets": [
